WEBVTT

00:00:04.809 --> 00:00:05.893
[Hiccup] Suit up, gang.

00:00:06.519 --> 00:00:07.770
We're going to get them back.

00:00:08.229 --> 00:00:09.230
What?

00:00:09.313 --> 00:00:10.898
He's lost his mind.

00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:13.901
Now that's marriage material.

00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:17.446
At last, faithful pupil, you are ready.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.823
Um...

00:00:18.906 --> 00:00:22.410
How are we gonna get our dragons back
without dragons?

00:00:22.576 --> 00:00:23.661
Trust me.

00:00:24.286 --> 00:00:26.414
[dragons calling]

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.291
Watch yourselves.

00:00:31.585 --> 00:00:32.628
Move it.

00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:33.838
[roars]

00:00:34.255 --> 00:00:35.673
[roars]

00:00:35.756 --> 00:00:39.885
Um, that's right, Alpha. No surprises.

00:00:41.762 --> 00:00:43.180
[Toothless calls]

00:00:44.348 --> 00:00:45.433
[guards groan]

00:00:48.936 --> 00:00:51.939
So, jump off the cliff

00:00:52.565 --> 00:00:53.983
in these.

00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:55.401
That's the best you've got?

00:00:55.484 --> 00:00:58.529
No, you guys are the best I've got.

00:00:58.612 --> 00:01:00.281
[gasps] Aw.

00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:02.241
-I'm with him! Who else?
-I'm with...

00:01:02.324 --> 00:01:04.118
Ruffnut, that was my line.

00:01:04.201 --> 00:01:05.202
[Hiccup] Let's go!

00:01:05.369 --> 00:01:06.454
[Astrid] Try to keep up!

00:01:06.537 --> 00:01:08.748
-[Hiccup grunts]
-[Astrid whoops]

00:01:10.499 --> 00:01:11.917
-Yeah!
-Whoo-hoo-hoo! Yeah!

00:01:12.001 --> 00:01:13.210
I'm doing it!

00:01:13.294 --> 00:01:14.545
[all whooping]

00:01:16.881 --> 00:01:18.340
[screeches]

00:01:18.424 --> 00:01:19.967
[groaning]

00:01:20.676 --> 00:01:22.636
[muffled roaring]

00:01:23.596 --> 00:01:24.638
-[growls]
-[gasps]

00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:26.849
Aw. [laughs]

00:01:27.141 --> 00:01:30.227
You didn't think I'd actually hand you
the Night Fury, did you?

00:01:30.686 --> 00:01:32.062
He's mine to kill.

00:01:32.146 --> 00:01:33.147
That snake.

00:01:33.731 --> 00:01:36.484
I intend to finish what I started.

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:40.696
Best of luck controlling them
without an alpha.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.781
[Hiccup in distance] Hold on, Toothless!

00:01:46.786 --> 00:01:48.037
[Tuffnut whimpering]

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.330
[Ruffnut] Let go!

00:01:49.413 --> 00:01:50.748
Could've used some practice.

00:01:50.831 --> 00:01:52.750
[whimpering]
I should've skipped breakfast.

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.335
[gasping]

00:01:54.835 --> 00:01:56.128
[grunts]

00:01:57.254 --> 00:01:58.506
[yelps]

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.217
[grunting]

00:02:04.386 --> 00:02:06.347
-[Hiccup] Toothless!
-[roars]

00:02:06.931 --> 00:02:08.349
[trappers screaming]

00:02:16.273 --> 00:02:18.192
-[Toothless calls]
-[Cloudjumper calls]

00:02:19.068 --> 00:02:20.569
[all grunting]

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.781
[whoops and grunts]

00:02:23.989 --> 00:02:24.949
[growls]

00:02:25.699 --> 00:02:26.909
Perfect timing.

00:02:27.535 --> 00:02:29.161
[trappers shouting indistinctly]

00:02:29.954 --> 00:02:30.955
Game faces.

00:02:31.038 --> 00:02:33.332
Yeah, what are you waiting for?
Get in there.

00:02:33.415 --> 00:02:34.416
[sighs]

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.294
-Yeah!
-Take that!

00:02:41.674 --> 00:02:42.842
[straining]

00:02:42.925 --> 00:02:44.260
[roaring]

00:02:45.135 --> 00:02:46.387
[groans]

00:02:47.805 --> 00:02:49.223
[chuckles]

00:02:49.473 --> 00:02:50.641
[yelps]

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:55.771
[grunts]

00:02:57.523 --> 00:02:58.983
[gasps and whistles]

00:02:59.108 --> 00:03:00.526
[shouts]

00:03:00.609 --> 00:03:03.696
-[creaking]
-[roaring]

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.578
[trappers yelling indistinctly]

00:03:13.414 --> 00:03:14.498
[both grunting]

00:03:16.792 --> 00:03:17.918
-[gasps]
-Heads up!

00:03:18.502 --> 00:03:19.712
-[screaming]
-Thanks.

00:03:19.795 --> 00:03:20.796
Look out! [grunts]

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.590
[grunts in pain]

00:03:23.883 --> 00:03:24.884
Thanks.

00:03:32.808 --> 00:03:33.934
[all shout]

00:03:36.395 --> 00:03:37.730
[wolf-whistles]

00:03:37.938 --> 00:03:39.440
[Stormfly squawks]

00:03:40.441 --> 00:03:41.567
[Hiccup grunts]

00:03:45.779 --> 00:03:48.032
-[dragon roars]
-[Hiccup shouts]

00:03:48.699 --> 00:03:49.533
[grunts]

00:03:50.951 --> 00:03:52.953
I'm coming, Toothless!

00:03:53.996 --> 00:03:55.831
You still think he cares about you?

00:03:56.665 --> 00:03:58.792
[Light Fury growling]

00:03:58.876 --> 00:04:01.837
Let's just see who he follows.

00:04:03.297 --> 00:04:04.131
[grunts softly]

00:04:05.674 --> 00:04:07.259
[roaring]

00:04:11.722 --> 00:04:13.265
[Hiccup grunts]

00:04:13.849 --> 00:04:16.393
I'm sorry, bud. For everything.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.271
[screeching]

00:04:34.954 --> 00:04:36.747
[Hiccup] Now let's go get her.

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:41.585
-[yelling]
-Whoo-hoo!

00:04:41.669 --> 00:04:42.836
Yeah!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.004
Number two coming through.

00:04:44.296 --> 00:04:45.422
Surprise.

00:04:45.756 --> 00:04:47.007
Sorry about that.

00:04:47.091 --> 00:04:48.884
Come on. [grunts]

00:04:49.635 --> 00:04:51.261
[roaring]

00:04:51.345 --> 00:04:53.347
[Snotlout] One more free. Four to go.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.933
[grunts and shouts]

00:04:56.475 --> 00:04:57.768
[Snotlout] Try to keep up.

00:04:58.435 --> 00:04:59.645
I got your backs.

00:04:59.728 --> 00:05:00.980
[yelling] Out of the way!

00:05:01.063 --> 00:05:02.564
-[trapper screams]
-[water splashes]

00:05:02.648 --> 00:05:05.025
Yeah, it's almost like we're a team.

00:05:05.651 --> 00:05:07.945
-[Fishmeat squeals]
-[trapper chuckles]

00:05:08.696 --> 00:05:11.365
You brought a baby to a battle.

00:05:11.532 --> 00:05:14.118
Uh-uh-uh.
I wouldn't do that if I were you.

00:05:14.451 --> 00:05:16.745
-[dragon roaring]
-[gasps]

00:05:17.496 --> 00:05:18.956
[trapper screams]

00:05:24.962 --> 00:05:26.547
I love that dragon.

00:05:27.881 --> 00:05:29.633
[growling]

00:05:31.593 --> 00:05:33.721
Sorry we're late for the party.

00:05:33.804 --> 00:05:35.597
You're right on time.

00:05:37.808 --> 00:05:39.184
[thunder cracking]

00:05:39.727 --> 00:05:41.895
[growls and groans]

00:05:41.979 --> 00:05:43.522
[Toothless roars]

00:05:45.274 --> 00:05:46.608
That's it. That's it.

